Hi,

I have 3 of these cards installed in my system: they allow a wordclock synch
of all cards by connecting them by a wordclock internal propetary cable.

Using Envy24Control -c x (x=0,1,2) I can start Envy24Control for each card,
and choose the master clock source: the problem is that the option displayed
are only internal clock generation (from 22050Hz to 96000Hz) and s/pdif
input as source clock.

Is it possible to apply some kind of patch to add wordclock option?

